      {
        "id": 55314,
        "name": "Reckless",
        "username": "Reckless",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-21T01:55:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think the frustration many people have is that Toolbox is a bad search card, which it is.&nbsp; Because it isn't a search card.&nbsp; On its own, Toolbox is a fine card, but using Toolbox to find a Tool when compared to, say, literally any card that allows a Hero to search for a card (minus Arsenal Access), it doesn't consistently get you what you need (what with it not being a card that allows you to search for a card).&nbsp; This is rather frustrating, but saying that Toolbox is a bad card because it can't search for cards is like saying you don't like the Mona Lisa because it's a bad music video.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That being said, I have had a few games where, with Toolbox, I would have to draw cards for three to five turns before I could get ahold of a Tool.&nbsp; Mad bummer.</p>",
        "post_number": 24,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:30:00.279Z",
