        "created_at": "2013-03-21T06:19:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm curious how people use Fixer against Spite. &nbsp;What combo do you go for? &nbsp;Bouncing Toolbox aside, does he pull his weight in this fight, in your opinion?</p>",
