        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-21T07:04:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I remember my first ever game with Rook City, Fixer-Expatriette-AbsoluteZero vs Spite. All other heroes incapacitated and Fixer with Driving Mantis, some tool and Harmony managed to edge out a win with 2 HP left.</p>",
