        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-21T14:07:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I agree that the only problem people have with the Toolbox is it's name. I love the card. I do like trying out house rules, though.</p>",
