        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-21T14:13:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Since this is a thread about what you like about Fixer I'll stay positive. I love the Pipewrench/Driving Mantis combo. If 3 damage is sent Fixer's way Pipewrench drops it to 2 so Driving Mantis activates for redirection. When you redirect you recalculate based on final target so it goes back up to 3. Math makes me smile. Pipewrench is also the only tool that lets Mantis activate while Bloody Knuckles is in play.</p><p>The Crowbar/Mantis combo is nice too since you can hit one target for 4 damage.</p>",
        "post_number": 30,
