        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-21T16:12:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Driving Mantis only works once per turn, so you would be unable to make effective use with Overdrive. It is still a good tactic against Spite, just not that good.</p>",
