      {
        "id": 55322,
        "name": "lynkfox",
        "username": "lynkfox",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lynkfox/{size}/1997_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-21T16:50:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah i had Wraith and Fixer against Spite (and someone else i forget whom lol) but a combination of Driving Mantis style, and TWO Stunbolts on wraith with the utility belt ment that Spite was a gonner. Even with nemisis boost and damage boosting, the double stunbolt damage reduction ment that he just wasnt able to do anything. And fixer being able to bounc back his style really kept Wraith in the game.</p>",
        "post_number": 32,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:30:00.888Z",
