      {
        "id": 55326,
        "name": "youperguy",
        "username": "youperguy",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/y/779978/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-27T14:42:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I find it interesting that Fixer is viewed in the cannon is a old mechanic, that a lot of the Villains underestimate.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A lot of players view him as weak hero as well, but then he does something great out of the blue.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Anyway, I think it fits his story that he is not obviously a great hero, but that sometimes makes you go \"What did he just do!\"</p>",
