      {
        "id": 55327,
        "name": "Sefirit",
        "username": "Sefirit",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/e68b1a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-27T18:47:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"j1hopki1\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> j1hopki1:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Since this is a thread about what you like about Fixer I'll stay positive. I love the Pipewrench/Driving Mantis combo.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This is the way I play him too.&nbsp; If I can get those I don't mind not doing a ton of damage on my turn cause I'm going to take a lot of damage away from allies and do a little extra damage outside of my turn anyway.</p>",
